# PC-99: every text file is checked out with LF on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# The licence files are hashed byte for byte (test/license.test.js), the release fixture is
# signed over its LF bytes (test/openpgp.test.js), and the process tests run test/fake-claude.js
# as the claude CLI through its shebang line, which a CRLF checkout breaks (env: node\r).
* text=auto eol=lf
